; [CHOSEN, not recovered] - the x64 twin of TextureAtlasBuilder.def (issue #7, the native x64 client):
; input to `lib /def: /machine:x64` in Code\Build\renddx9.cmd x64 so the x64 RendDX9.dll imports the two
; creates of the x64 TextureAtlasBuilder.dll by name. The names are the x64 MSVC decorations of the same
; ITextureAtlas.h declarations: 64-bit pointers (PEA) and no __fastcall on x64 (the static creates
; mangle as __cdecl, SA). Code\Build\textureatlasbuilder.cmd x64 checks its exports against them.
LIBRARY TextureAtlasBuilder
EXPORTS
    ?create@ITextureAtlas@textureatlas@@SAPEAV12@PEAUIDirect3DDevice9@@@Z
    ?create@ITextureAtlasConfiguration@textureatlas@@SAPEAV12@XZ
